This crate translates parts of JIP LN NVSE, the largest plugin of xNVSE (the New Vegas Script
Extender), into Rust (ADR-0016), with its authors' permission (the maintainer, 2026-11-03),
JIP's own code and the part that came from the former lutana plugin included. Source: JIP LN
NVSE 57.30, https://github.com/jazzisparis/JIP-LN-NVSE, commit 5a30ac4. No C++ is included.

Credits: JIP LN NVSE is written by jazzisparis. Its block of commands at opcode 0x2200
(`functions_ln/`, `internal/lutana.h`) began as the lutana NVSE plugin (`lutana_nvse`), whose
author JIP's source does not name; JIP still answers to that plugin's name.

JIP LN NVSE is licensed under the GNU General Public License, version 3 (its LICENSE file, the
same text as this repository's LICENSE), and this translation is distributed under it.

JIP's `nvse/` folder holds NVSE's headers as xNVSE has them; NVSE's and xNVSE's credits and
notices are in crates/nvse/NOTICE.

The lists in `data/` are facts read from JIP's source and from its shipped DLL (jip_nvse.dll
57.30): names, opcodes, parameter types and flags. No bytes of the DLL are included.
